-- Collège informatics curriculum (7ᵉ, 8ᵉ, 9ᵉ année de base), from the Tunisian ministry's
-- « Aides pédagogiques d'Informatique » (sept. 2024). Generated from the content pack's
-- structure.json: a module becomes a course, a leçon a chapter, and each leçon's quiz a quiz on
-- its module. Lesson PDFs are not here: they go through the upload API so they land in storage.
--
-- Rows are found again by course code and title rather than by id, so this runs on a database
-- that already has data.


